MetaEncoder evaluation

This repository includes code adapted from VLM2Vec
(https://github.com/TIGER-AI-Lab/VLM2Vec), licensed under the Apache License 2.0:
metaencoder_eval/tasks/, metaencoder_eval/metrics.py and metaencoder_eval/utils/.

Changes: imports were rewritten for this package; prompt construction was reduced to the
MetaEncoder format; unused code, experiment switches and the generic text-retrieval loader were
removed (NanoBEIR has its own loader); the Video-MMMU parser follows the official protocol.
